Error: a closure cannot `await`
    ╭─[ src/main.inset:16:52 ]
    │
 16 │         let total: u32 = vec![1, 2].iter().map(|_| self.tally.total().await).sum();
    │                                                    ────────────┬───────────  
    │                                                                ╰───────────── this waits inside a closure
    │ 
    │ Help: await in the function's body, outside the closure, so the flowchart shows the call as a step of its own
